<title>REPUBLIC OF IRELAND: Irish June industrial output rises 2.0 pct m/m.</title>
<headline>Irish June industrial output rises 2.0 pct m/m.</headline>
<dateline>DUBLIN 1996-10-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Irish industrial production rose a seasonally adjusted 2.0 percent in June and rose 13.1 percent year-on-year, Central Statistics Office (CSO) data showed on Friday.  </p>
<p>Manufacturing production fell 0.9 percent in June and was up 15.0 percent year-on-year.</p>
